ex:N_Alloc2 a backlog:CapacityAllocation ;
    backlog:allocatesToCategory backlog:Cat_Maintenance ; backlog:hasTargetShare 0.2 .

# DEFECT 37: project with no scope, phase, objective or Definition of Done
